+
+## Example Usage
+
+`/indicator-chart ema SBIN NSE D`
+`/indicator-chart rsi RELIANCE NSE D`
+`/indicator-chart macd AAPL YFINANCE D`
+`/indicator-chart supertrend NIFTY NSE_INDEX D`
