+response = client.intervals()
+# Returns: {"minutes": ["1m", "3m", "5m", "10m", "15m", "30m"],
+#           "hours": ["1h"], "days": ["D"], "weeks": [], "months": []}
+```
+
+### Real-Time Quotes
+
+```python
+# Single symbol
+quote = client.quotes(symbol="SBIN", exchange="NSE")
+# Returns: {open, high, low, ltp, bid, ask, prev_close, volume}
+
+# Multiple symbols
